{"q":{"g":"In this quest you have to find a flash drive on Streets of Tarkov. It can be found on a desk inside the LexOs car dealership director's office, which is located in the closed section on the second floor. A Car dealership closed section key is required to access the office, and the Car dealership director's office room key provided by Peacekeeper via in-game mail is required to open it. Be aware that the premises of the LexOs car dealership are riddled with Claymores.","sh":[{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/8/80/CarDealerMap.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230826213528","c":"Car dealership marked on map"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/d/df/LexOsClaymoreOverview.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20260811162649","c":"LexOs complex overview"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/a/a4/CarDealer.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20231203123016","c":"The car dealership"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/1/15/CarDealerClosedSectionDoor.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230101015454","c":"Grate door to the closed section"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/a/a4/CarDealerOfficeDoor.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230101022120","c":"Door to the office"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/d/d3/CarDealerOfficeInside.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230101022506","c":"Inside the office"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/7/7f/YCNAS_Flashdrive_location.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230605011315","c":"Flash drive on the desk"}]},"o":{},"x":{}}